00:38:05,660 --> 00:38:09,660
ねえ ずっとずっとそばにいたんだ 「勘違いだ」って 嘘じゃないよ
Hey, I was always by your side—saying "it's a mistake" isn't a lie.

612
00:38:09,660 --> 00:38:13,560
望んだものじゃなくとも あなたに出会えた
Even if it wasn't what I wished for, I was able to meet you.

613
00:38:13,560 --> 00:38:18,260
痛みだけが愛だって信じられるように
So that I can believe this pain alone is love...

614
00:38:18,260 --> 00:38:22,360
僕に触れないで 祈るセレナーデ
Don't touch me—a praying serenade.

615
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:25,860
僕なしで上手く幸せになってね
Please find a way to be happy without me.

616
00:38:25,860 --> 00:38:29,460
誰よりもずっと 何を手放しても
More than anyone, no matter what I let go of,

617
00:38:29,460 --> 00:38:34,660
これが愛だって信じていた 罰をください
I believed this was love—please give me my punishment.

618
00:38:34,660 --> 00:38:38,260
誰でもない あなた あなただけ
No one else, just you, only you.

619
00:38:38,260 --> 00:38:41,760
世界がまだ忘れてくれなくても
Even if the world refuses to forget me yet,

620
00:38:41,760 --> 00:38:45,260
きっとまだ あなた あなただけ
surely still, it's you, only you.

621
00:38:45,260 --> 00:38:51,060
願い疲れても歌うよ セレナーデ
Even worn out from wishing, I'll sing: serenade.

622
00:38:51,060 --> 00:38:57,060
願い疲れても歌うよ セレナーデ
Even worn out from wishing, I'll sing: serenade.

623
00:38:57,060 --> 00:39:00,760
シナリオ通りのコメディ 不幸自慢はハウメニー？
A comedy right on script—how many boasts of misfortune?

624
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:04,860
エゴイスティックに光った瞳の中に映ってる あなたは誰？
Reflected in those egotistically shining eyes, who are you?

625
00:39:04,860 --> 00:39:10,460
暗闇が光らせた舞台の上で 何も知らずにただ踊っていられたならよかった
On the stage illuminated by darkness, if only I could've danced knowing nothing.

626
00:39:10,460 --> 00:39:14,860
希望も不幸も身勝手だ 僕ら全員共犯者だった
Hope and misfortune are both selfish; we were all accomplices.

627
00:39:14,860 --> 00:39:21,860
疑う余地もないほど 運命が定まったあの夜から 僕は愛し方を忘れた
Since that night when fate was sealed beyond doubt, I forgot how to love.

628
00:39:21,860 --> 00:39:27,960
これだけ願って これだけ祈って こんな悲しい結末でごめんね
After wishing this much, praying this much—I'm sorry for such a sad ending.

629
00:39:28,060 --> 00:39:31,560
すべて失って すべて消え去っても
Even if I lose everything and everything fades away,

630
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:40,560
ただ君がずっと生きていた痛みが欲しい
I just want the pain that proves you truly lived.

631
00:39:52,860 --> 00:39:56,560
あと何回数えたら あと何回傷つけば
How many more times must I count? How many more times must I be hurt?

632
00:39:56,560 --> 00:40:00,060
あと何回失えば あと何回壊れ...
How many more times must I lose? How many more times must I break...?

633
00:40:00,096 --> 00:40:02,246
あと何回数えたら
How many more times must I count,

634
00:40:02,246 --> 00:40:04,296
あと何回傷つけば
how many more times must I be hurt,

635
00:40:04,296 --> 00:40:06,196
あと何回失えば
how many more times must I lose something,

636
00:40:06,196 --> 00:40:08,596
この想いは満たされ
before these feelings are fulfilled?

637
00:40:08,796 --> 00:40:10,996
これだけ願って
I wished this much,

638
00:40:10,996 --> 00:40:12,796
これだけ祈って
I prayed this much,

639
00:40:12,796 --> 00:40:15,596
こんな悲しい結末でごめんね
I'm sorry it's such a sad ending.

640
00:40:15,746 --> 00:40:17,696
全て失って
Even if I lose everything,

641
00:40:17,696 --> 00:40:19,546
全て間違いでも
even if it was all a mistake,

642
00:40:19,546 --> 00:40:23,296
ただ僕がずっと愛していた君よ
you, whom I have always loved,

643
00:40:23,446 --> 00:40:26,596
消えないで祈るセレナーデ
a serenade praying you don't disappear.

644
00:40:26,596 --> 00:40:29,746
昔出逢った 幸せになってね
To the you I met back then, please be happy.

645
00:40:29,796 --> 00:40:32,096
誰よりもずっと
More than anyone else,

646
00:40:32,096 --> 00:40:33,496
どんなに手を放しても
no matter how we let go of each other's hands,

647
00:40:33,496 --> 00:40:36,496
これが愛だって信じてた
I believed this was love.

648
00:40:36,496 --> 00:40:38,896
罰をください
Please punish me.

649
00:40:38,896 --> 00:40:42,596
誰でもない あなた あなただけ
No one else, but you, only you.

650
00:40:42,596 --> 00:40:45,796
世界がまだ 忘れてくれなくても
Even if the world won't forget yet,

651
00:40:45,796 --> 00:40:49,096
きっとまだ あなた あなただけ
surely still, you, only you.

652
00:40:49,096 --> 00:40:54,096
願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Even tired of wishing, I'll sing this serenade.

653
00:40:55,296 --> 00:40:57,496
雨が降り去っても
Even after the rain falls and passes,

654
00:40:57,496 --> 00:40:59,496
僕じゃ駄目だって
even if I wasn't the right one,

655
00:40:59,496 --> 00:41:05,096
願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
even tired of wishing, I'll sing this serenade.

656
00:41:13,896 --> 00:41:15,396
Kronii!

657
00:41:15,396 --> 00:41:18,596
I've come to save you!

658
00:41:18,596 --> 00:41:23,596
I knew it, Subaru-senpai!

659
00:41:23,696 --> 00:41:26,296
How'd'ya I needed help?
How'd you know I needed help?

660
00:41:26,396 --> 00:41:30,996
I've been watching the whole time!

661
00:41:31,096 --> 00:41:32,496
The whole time...?

662
00:41:32,496 --> 00:41:33,096
Yeah.

663
00:41:33,096 --> 00:41:34,296
And me?

664
00:41:34,296 --> 00:41:35,896
I watch you.
I watched you.

665
00:41:35,996 --> 00:41:38,596
Oh, okay. That's scary, but...

666
00:41:38,696 --> 00:41:39,896
The why?!
Why?!

667
00:41:39,996 --> 00:41:43,296
I, I wish you helped me a lot sooner then!
I wish you helped me a lot sooner then!

668
00:41:43,396 --> 00:41:48,896
Well, you started having fun halfway through,

669
00:41:50,596 --> 00:41:57,496
so I figured I'd see how things played out!

670
00:41:57,496 --> 00:41:58,796
Yeah.

671
00:41:58,896 --> 00:42:00,896
I watched...

672
00:42:00,896 --> 00:42:02,096
just the...

673
00:42:02,096 --> 00:42:03,296
world.

674
00:42:03,296 --> 00:42:06,096
Oh, yeah. The world. Yeah.

675
00:42:06,096 --> 00:42:10,096
Yeah. I mean, I guess I did end up enjoying parts of it.

676
00:42:10,096 --> 00:42:11,396
See?!

677
00:42:11,496 --> 00:42:17,496
That's why I was wondering whether you actually needed saving!

678
00:42:17,596 --> 00:42:20,596
Aw... well thank you, I guess,

679
00:42:20,596 --> 00:42:24,796
