680
00:42:24,896 --> 00:42:27,296
Just...

681
00:42:28,096 --> 00:42:30,896
Please wait. Just...

682
00:42:30,896 --> 00:42:32,096
where are you looking?

683
00:42:32,096 --> 00:42:34,096
Just one more song.

684
00:42:34,096 --> 00:42:37,396
If you sing and dance your heart out,

685
00:42:37,396 --> 00:42:40,096
