686
00:42:40,096 --> 00:42:42,296
Really? Yay!

687
00:42:42,296 --> 00:42:45,396
Just watch the world!

688
00:42:45,396 --> 00:42:46,996
The world!

689
00:42:47,096 --> 00:42:49,896
Oh, so that's the world.

690
00:42:50,096 --> 00:42:51,096
やべー
Oh no...

691
00:42:51,096 --> 00:42:54,496
Oh, okay. Wait. Sorry. I was so fascinated.

692
00:42:54,496 --> 00:42:56,296
Please staff, please staff

693
00:42:56,296 --> 00:42:59,096
Down up up up up up up.

694
00:42:59,096 --> 00:43:00,696
Yeah, yeah!

695
00:43:00,796 --> 00:43:03,296
Really?!

696
00:43:03,396 --> 00:43:09,996
Kaela disappeared after fighting and singing, right?

697
00:43:09,996 --> 00:43:10,896
Yeah.

698
00:43:10,896 --> 00:43:15,596
That's because she went back to the original world.

699
00:43:15,596 --> 00:43:18,896
After fighting and singing?

700
00:43:18,996 --> 00:43:22,596
Wait, does that mean I have to fight too?

701
00:43:22,596 --> 00:43:24,096
Yep!

702
00:43:24,096 --> 00:43:25,596
Oh...

703
00:43:30,296 --> 00:43:32,096
I don't get it!

704
00:43:32,096 --> 00:43:34,296
Why do we have to fight at all?!

705
00:43:34,396 --> 00:43:39,196
Think of it like some kind of ritual!

706
00:43:39,596 --> 00:43:43,796
Okay, then we just stand there and take the hit,

707
00:43:43,796 --> 00:43:46,596
and when we get back to the real world,

708
00:43:46,596 --> 00:43:51,096
you're going to make me food and spoil me!!!

709
00:43:51,096 --> 00:43:57,696
やばい！やばい！やばい！やばい！やばい！やばい！
This is bad! This is bad! This is bad! This is bad!

710
00:43:57,696 --> 00:44:00,996
Stop! Please stop please stop please.

711
00:44:01,096 --> 00:44:02,896
YOU!

712
00:44:02,896 --> 00:44:04,596
Are you okay?!
Are you out of your mind?!

713
00:44:05,596 --> 00:44:07,196
Are you okay?

714
00:44:07,196 --> 00:44:07,796
No.

715
00:44:07,896 --> 00:44:10,596
Wait, why should I cook for you?!

716
00:44:10,596 --> 00:44:16,596
And besides, you were already getting spoiled earlier!

717
00:44:18,696 --> 00:44:20,196
Anyway!

718
00:44:20,196 --> 00:44:22,396
You should have fun!

719
00:44:22,396 --> 00:44:25,096
Joy is the key!

720
00:44:25,196 --> 00:44:27,796
You sure about that?

721
00:44:27,796 --> 00:44:30,896
Then you have to entertain me.

722
00:44:30,896 --> 00:44:32,596
Meow!

723
00:44:32,596 --> 00:44:35,396
Eh? Meow?
Huh? Meow?

724
00:44:35,796 --> 00:44:37,496
Are you okay...?

725
00:44:37,496 --> 00:44:38,296
No.

726
00:44:38,396 --> 00:44:41,896
Anyway!

727
00:44:41,896 --> 00:44:45,396
I summon Subatomo!

728
00:44:46,096 --> 00:44:47,896
Come on!

729
00:44:48,596 --> 00:44:51,096
Subatomo is soooo cute!
Subatomo is so cute!

730
00:44:51,096 --> 00:44:54,896
This is "super cute" right? Right?
This is "super cute," right?

731
00:44:54,896 --> 00:44:58,296
Yeah, but it's so tiny.

732
00:44:58,296 --> 00:44:59,396
Tiny?

733
00:44:59,396 --> 00:45:00,896
It's so small.

734
00:45:00,896 --> 00:45:03,596
Yeah! Small is cute!

735
00:45:03,596 --> 00:45:04,396
Just looking at it makes you happy, right?

736
00:45:05,084 --> 00:45:07,884
Just looking at it make you happy, right? Yeah?
Just looking at it makes you happy, right? Yeah?

737
00:45:07,984 --> 00:45:11,484
Yeah, I mean, it's very adorable, but...

738
00:45:11,684 --> 00:45:12,784
...I'm...

739
00:45:13,084 --> 00:45:15,584
I'm also right here too.

740
00:45:15,584 --> 00:45:17,084
Meow~

741
00:45:17,084 --> 00:45:18,684
Meow meow~

742
00:45:18,884 --> 00:45:20,984
クローニーもマジで可愛い！
Kronii is super cute, too!

743
00:45:21,084 --> 00:45:24,584
But, but this is...

744
00:45:24,884 --> 00:45:26,884
これなに？
What is this?

745
00:45:27,084 --> 00:45:28,784
シャイ シャイ クローニー？
Shy Shy Kronii?

746
00:45:28,784 --> 00:45:31,584
No! No, stoppppp!

747
00:45:32,084 --> 00:45:35,284
え、でも、クローニーはにゃーなの？
Is Kronii a meow?

748
00:45:35,884 --> 00:45:38,084
Um... I-I-it's fine.

749
00:45:38,084 --> 00:45:40,884
If you don't know, then, never mind.

750
00:45:40,884 --> 00:45:42,784
It's... it's whatever.

751
00:45:42,884 --> 00:45:45,884
That's... way too creepy, Kronii!

752
00:45:45,884 --> 00:45:47,584
HEY what's that mean?!

753
00:45:47,684 --> 00:45:51,484
Today Kronii is a little, little, are you okay?
Today Kronii is a little... Are you okay?

754
00:45:51,484 --> 00:45:53,084
Are you okay? 大丈夫？
Are you okay? Are you okay?

755
00:45:53,184 --> 00:45:56,584
Hey, that's... I'm never okay. But you shouldn't say that!

756
00:45:56,684 --> 00:45:59,684
Anyway, aren't we supposed to fight though?

757
00:45:59,884 --> 00:46:02,084
Ah, yeah! All right!

758
00:46:02,384 --> 00:46:04,884
Subatomo are you okay?

759
00:46:05,084 --> 00:46:08,084
Go Subatomo!

760
00:46:08,884 --> 00:46:12,584
Yeah! Attack! Go go go go go! Attack! Attack!

761
00:46:14,584 --> 00:46:17,084
You!!

762
00:46:17,984 --> 00:46:20,484
Come! Back back back back!

763
00:46:20,484 --> 00:46:21,884
Are you okay? 大丈夫？
Are you okay?

764
00:46:22,084 --> 00:46:24,884
Subatomo... なんか... ちょっと弱いかもー
Subatomo... might be a little underwhelming...

765
00:46:24,884 --> 00:46:27,384
This lil guy's a weakling. ウィークかもこいつ
This lil guy's a weakling.

766
00:46:27,584 --> 00:46:30,584
Well, I guess I should start getting prepared.

767
00:46:30,584 --> 00:46:32,084
It doesn't even hurt.

768
00:46:32,084 --> 00:46:34,084
Not even a tickle. Sorry.
Not even tickle. Sorry.

769
00:46:35,884 --> 00:46:39,084
This is bad! Really bad! やばいぞ！やばい！
This is bad! Really bad!

770
00:46:40,884 --> 00:46:43,884
Subatomo!!

771
00:46:43,884 --> 00:46:47,084
We're taking this one together!

772
00:46:47,084 --> 00:46:49,284
Oh no! Oh no!

773
00:46:49,584 --> 00:46:52,884
もう身代わりだよお前が！
You're my shield now!

774
00:46:53,084 --> 00:46:56,584
Please, mercy! Please, mercy! Please!

775
00:46:56,584 --> 00:46:58,084
Here I go...

776
00:46:58,084 --> 00:46:59,884
Please mercy!

777
00:46:59,884 --> 00:47:05,584
Waaah!

778
00:47:05,584 --> 00:47:08,084
そんなのってないよ...
That's terrible...

779
00:47:08,084 --> 00:47:10,584
Yayyy!

780
00:47:10,584 --> 00:47:13,084
I'm sorry, but yayyyyy!

781
00:47:13,084 --> 00:47:16,084
Subatomo----!

782
00:47:16,084 --> 00:47:19,084
大丈夫かスバ友！
Are you okay, Subatomo?

783
00:47:19,584 --> 00:47:21,884
Oh, it's alive, oh, thank god, okay.

784
00:47:22,084 --> 00:47:24,084
大変だった もう
That was rough.

785
00:47:24,084 --> 00:47:28,584
See? You're having fun!

786
00:47:28,584 --> 00:47:32,084
This should probably get you home now!

787
00:47:32,284 --> 00:47:34,084
Good luck!

788
00:47:34,084 --> 00:47:35,884
Yeah! Thank you!

789
00:47:36,084 --> 00:47:37,584
Bye!

790
00:47:37,584 --> 00:47:39,084
Go home!

791
00:47:39,084 --> 00:47:40,584
帰ろうスバ友
Go home, Subatomo!

792
00:47:40,584 --> 00:47:41,584
Bye!

793
00:47:43,584 --> 00:47:45,084
What was that?

794
00:47:48,084 --> 00:47:51,584
I don't really get what's going on, but

795
00:47:51,584 --> 00:47:55,084
apparently I can go home if I sing one last song.

796
00:47:55,084 --> 00:47:57,084
So let's do that.

797
00:47:58,884 --> 00:48:01,584
Wait. What's this?

798
00:48:02,084 --> 00:48:06,084
What? Okay, okay.

799
00:48:06,284 --> 00:48:10,584
Let's go through them one by one from the top.

800
00:48:10,584 --> 00:48:13,584
Maybe they'll be useful for something.

801
00:48:13,584 --> 00:48:14,584
Hmm.

802
00:48:16,084 --> 00:48:21,084
Ouro Kronii 5th Anniversary... Ah!

803
00:48:21,584 --> 00:48:26,084
So these are the merch celebrating my anniversary, ey?

804
00:48:26,084 --> 00:48:28,884
Let's see. I wonder what they've got.

805
00:48:28,884 --> 00:48:32,584
They all seem pretty useful, so let's check it out together.

806
00:48:32,584 --> 00:48:35,884
First up, we got a bucket hat.

807
00:48:35,884 --> 00:48:39,884
The illustration was done by Hama Nashi sensei.

808
00:48:39,884 --> 00:48:44,884
The concept is me being... you guessed it, the final boss!

809
00:48:44,884 --> 00:48:49,284
It's reversible and the artwork looks really cool!

810
00:48:49,284 --> 00:48:54,084
And maybe it would make you feel like it would boost your defense stat!

811
00:48:54,084 --> 00:48:59,084
And next up, we got a random attribute acrylic keychain.

812
00:48:59,084 --> 00:49:03,084
The chibi characters were drawn by Gurin sensei!

813
00:49:03,084 --> 00:49:06,584
I wonder which one you'll get ey ey?
I wonder which one you'll get, ey? Ey, ey?

814
00:49:06,584 --> 00:49:11,584
And after the acrylic keychain, we got a Cushion!

815
00:49:11,584 --> 00:49:15,584
The design for this was also done by Gurin sensei.

816
00:49:15,584 --> 00:49:19,084
The cushion has an illustration on both sides,

817
00:49:19,084 --> 00:49:22,584
and size wise, it's pretty easy to use as well.
and size-wise, it's pretty easy to use as well.

818
00:49:22,584 --> 00:49:27,084
Next up, we got this cute Boros Lamp!

819
00:49:27,084 --> 00:49:31,584
Looks like you can adjust the brightness between two levels,

820
00:49:31,584 --> 00:49:34,884
and the design is super duper cute,

821
00:49:34,884 --> 00:49:38,084
you'll be safe even in dark places.

822
00:49:38,084 --> 00:49:41,584
When you're scared he's got you. Don't worry everyone.

823
00:49:41,884 --> 00:49:46,084
And coming up next, we got a situation voice pack!

824
00:49:46,084 --> 00:49:50,084
The title being Villainous Kronii's Final Loop.

825
00:49:50,084 --> 00:49:54,084
Sounds pretty ominous, but, I can't wait to check it out!

826
00:49:54,084 --> 00:49:57,584
I want to check it out I wanna listen to it already!

827
00:49:57,584 --> 00:50:00,084
And finally, if you purchase everything,

828
00:50:00,120 --> 00:50:01,120
...if you purchase everything,

829
00:50:01,120 --> 00:50:06,120
you'll also receive a cheki-style card with a foil stamped signature,

830
00:50:06,720 --> 00:50:10,320
along with a bonus voice pack.

831
00:50:10,920 --> 00:50:16,920
The card illustration was drawn by, you guessed it, Hama Nashi sensei.

832
00:50:17,420 --> 00:50:19,920
And as for the bonus voice pack,

833
00:50:19,920 --> 00:50:27,920
it's going to be telling the story of joining hands and heading into the final battle in order to bring the loop to an end.

834
00:50:28,120 --> 00:50:32,320
It's going to be very emotional, so go check it out.

835
00:50:32,920 --> 00:50:36,320
Once more, here is the full line up.

836
00:50:36,920 --> 00:50:41,320
